{
  "ledger": "udemy",
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-20",
  "title": "Udemy台帳（コース別の累計登録・月間登録・累計収益）",
  "howToUse": "Udemyのインストラクター画面のスクショから、C01〜C10の10本ぶんをそろえて1本のJSONにする。",
  "fileNamePattern": "^intake_udemy_\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}_\\d{4}\\.json$",
  "mimeType": "application/json",
  "sheetName": "Udemy台帳_base",
  "folder": "udemy",
  "shape": "rows",
  "rowsKey": "courses",
  "rowCount": {
    "min": 10,
    "max": 10
  },
  "rowKey": "id",
  "uniqueRowKey": true,
  "dateKey": "date",
  "fields": {
    "date": {
      "type": "date",
      "required": true,
      "sameAsFileDate": true,
      "col": "記録日",
      "label": "記録日"
    },
    "time": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "pattern": "^\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}$",
      "col": "基準時刻",
      "label": "基準時刻"
    },
    "src": {
      "type": "string",
      "nullable": true,
      "col": "出所",
      "label": "出所"
    }
  },
  "rowFields": {
    "id": {
      "type": "enum",
      "required": true,
      "enum": [
        "C01",
        "C02",
        "C03",
        "C04",
        "C05",
        "C06",
        "C07",
        "C08",
        "C09",
        "C10"
      ],
      "col": "コースID",
      "label": "コースID"
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "maxLen": 120,
      "col": "コース名",
      "label": "コース名"
    },
    "published": {
      "type": "string",
      "nullable": true,
      "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}$",
      "col": "公開年月",
      "label": "公開年月"
    },
    "cum_enroll": {
      "type": "int",
      "required": true,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200000,
      "col": "累計登録",
      "label": "累計登録"
    },
    "month_enroll": {
      "type": "int",
      "nullable": true,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 5000,
      "col": "月間登録",
      "label": "月間登録"
    },
    "cum_revenue_usd": {
      "type": "number",
      "nullable": true,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 1000000,
      "col": "累計収益USD",
      "label": "累計収益(USD)",
      "colAliases": [
        "累計収益",
        "収益"
      ]
    },
    "rating": {
      "type": "number",
      "nullable": true,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 5,
      "col": "評価",
      "label": "評価"
    },
    "memo": {
      "type": "string",
      "nullable": true,
      "maxLen": 200,
      "col": "施策メモ",
      "label": "施策メモ",
      "colAliases": [
        "施策",
        "メモ"
      ]
    }
  },
  "example": {
    "date": "2026-09-14",
    "time": "6:30",
    "src": "Udemyインストラクター画面",
    "courses": [
      {
        "id": "C01",
        "name": "はじめてのマーケティング",
        "published": "2021-10",
        "cum_enroll": 12345,
        "month_enroll": 120,
        "cum_revenue_usd": 32100.5,
        "rating": 4.5,
        "memo": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "notes": [
    "courses は10要素ちょうど。11要素目や「全体」「合計」の行はスキーマ違反として拒否する（月間の二重計上の元）。",
    "コースIDは C01〜C10 だけ。同じIDを2回書くのも拒否。",
    "累計登録・累計収益は「累計」なので前回より減ることは無い。減っていたら数字の取り違えを疑う。"
  ]
}
